@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title WF-3: SOC Alert Handling (v3.3 - via Detection Engine API)

participant "SOC Analyst\n(Browser)" as S #CCE5FF
participant "Core App\n(port 8000)" as CA #DAE8FC
participant "Detection Engine\n(port 8001)" as DE #FFF2CC
database "core-db" as CDB #F5F5F5
database "detection-db" as DDB #F5F5F5

== Authentication ==

S -> CA : **POST /api/v1/auth/login**\n(username, password)
activate CA
CA --> S : **200 OK** {access_token, role=SOC_ANALYST}
deactivate CA

== List Alerts ==

S -> DE : **GET /api/v1/alerts**\n?status=open&risk_level=high\n+ Bearer {access_token}
activate DE

DE -> DE : Validate JWT\n(role=SOC_ANALYST)
DE -> DDB : SELECT alerts\nWHERE status=? AND risk_level=?\nORDER BY created_at DESC
activate DDB
DDB --> DE : [alert1, alert2, ...]
deactivate DDB

DE --> S : **200 OK**\n{alerts: [{id, login_attempt_id,\nrisk_level, status, created_at}]}
deactivate DE

== Alert Detail ==

S -> DE : **GET /api/v1/alerts/{id}**\n+ Bearer {access_token}
activate DE

DE -> DDB : SELECT alerts WHERE id=?
activate DDB
DDB --> DE : alert record
deactivate DDB

DE -> DDB : SELECT login_attempts WHERE id=alert.login_attempt_id
activate DDB
DDB --> DE : login attempt context
deactivate DDB

DE -> DDB : SELECT risk_assessments WHERE login_attempt_id=?
activate DDB
DDB --> DE : risk scoring details
deactivate DDB

DE --> S : **200 OK**\n{alert, login_attempt, risk_assessment}
deactivate DE

== Alert Actions ==

alt Acknowledge Alert
    S -> DE : **PATCH /api/v1/alerts/{id}**\n{status: "acknowledged", notes: "..."}\n+ Bearer {access_token}
    activate DE
    
    DE -> DE : Validate JWT, role=SOC_ANALYST
    DE -> CDB : (HTTP) **GET /api/v1/internal/users/{user_id}**\nđể validate SOC analyst
    activate CDB
    CDB --> DE : user record (role=SOC_ANALYST)
    deactivate CDB
    
    DE -> DDB : UPDATE alerts\n(status=acknowledged, assigned_to_id,\nupdated_at=NOW())
    activate DDB
    DDB --> DE : updated alert
    deactivate DDB
    
    DE -> DDB : INSERT alert_timeline\n(event_type=acknowledged,\nactor_id, old_value=open,\nnew_value=acknowledged, comment)
    
    DE --> S : **200 OK**\n{alert: {status: "acknowledged"}}
    deactivate DE

else Resolve Alert
    S -> DE : **PATCH /api/v1/alerts/{id}**\n{status: "resolved", resolution: "..."}\n+ Bearer {access_token}
    activate DE
    
    DE -> CDB : validate SOC analyst via HTTP
    DE -> DDB : UPDATE alerts\n(status=resolved, resolved_by_id,\nresolved_at=NOW(), resolution, notes)
    activate DDB
    DDB --> DE : updated alert
    deactivate DDB
    
    DE -> DDB : INSERT alert_timeline\n(event_type=resolved, actor_id,\nresolved_by_id, old_value=acknowledged,\nnew_value=resolved, comment)
    
    DE --> S : **200 OK**\n{alert: {status: "resolved"}}
    deactivate DE

else Mark False Positive
    S -> DE : **PATCH /api/v1/alerts/{id}**\n{status: "false_positive", notes: "user traveling"}\n+ Bearer {access_token}
    activate DE
    
    DE -> DDB : UPDATE alerts\n(status=false_positive, resolved_by_id,\nresolved_at=NOW(), notes)
    activate DDB
    DDB --> DE : updated alert
    deactivate DDB
    
    DE -> DDB : INSERT alert_timeline\n(event_type=false_positive)
    
    DE --> S : **200 OK**\n{alert: {status: "false_positive"}}
    deactivate DE

else Escalate Alert
    S -> DE : **PATCH /api/v1/alerts/{id}**\n{action: "escalate", notes: "..."}\n+ Bearer {access_token}
    activate DE
    
    DE -> DDB : UPDATE alerts\n(notes=escalated)
    DE -> DDB : INSERT alert_timeline\n(event_type=escalated)
    
    DE --> S : **200 OK**\n{alert: {escalated: true}}
    deactivate DE
end

== SOC Dashboard Stats ==

S -> DE : **GET /api/v1/soc/dashboard**\n?timeframe=24h\n+ Bearer {access_token}
activate DE

DE -> DDB : SELECT COUNT(*) FROM alerts\nWHERE created_at > NOW()-24h
DE -> DDB : SELECT COUNT(*) FROM alerts\nWHERE status='open'
DE -> DDB : SELECT COUNT(*) GROUP BY risk_level

DE --> S : **200 OK**\n{stats: {total, open, by_risk_level}}
deactivate DE

note over S, DDB
  **SOC Action Flow (v3.3):**
  1. SOC → POST /alerts/{id}/actions
  2. DE validates analyst, calls /internal/actions → Core App
  3. Core App: REVOKE_SESSIONS → {sessions_revoked: N}
  4. SOC nhận {status: applied, details.sessions_revoked}

  **Alert State Machine:**
  open → acknowledged → resolved
                   ↘ false_positive
end note

@enduml
